title: "Task Splitter: Claude Code skill for cost-optimized model routing"
abstract: "Cut Claude Code cost: split a task into subtasks, score difficulty, route each to the cheapest capable model (inline shell, Haiku, Sonnet, Opus), batch same-tier work into one subagent, verify with scripts, escalate only failures."
